OL,3,GNEWSABuilding work under way for #450m
OL,4,Acity revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirteen months after demolition work
OL,7,Fstarted on the #450m redevelopment of
OL,8,FCoventry city centre, the first of its
OL,9,Fnew buildings is rising from the
OL,10,Frubble.
OL,12,FCity Centre South is Coventry City
OL,13,FCouncil's project to re-design the
OL,14,Fsouthern half of the city centre. It is
OL,15,Fexpected to bring more than 1,500 new
OL,16,Fhomes, 18,000 sq m (21,529 sq yds) of
OL,17,Fpublic space, restaurants, shops and
OL,18,Fother leisure facilities.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
