OL,3,GNEWSABuilding work under way for #450m
OL,4,Acity revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FLynette Kelly, the council's deputy
OL,7,Fleader, said the retail sector is
OL,8,Fchanging and "people might go to shops,
OL,9,Ftake a quick look around but then go
OL,10,Fhome and order the size they want to
OL,11,Fget delivered to their house".
OL,13,FSuch changing habits meant original
OL,14,Fplans for a flagship store were
OL,15,Fabandoned.
